FINAL ANSWER:
## History of `lib/index.js`

**Who started it:** Troy Goode wrote the first commit on 2013-01-30. Commits under <email redacted> run to 2016-08-23. The file is 214 non-blank lines (238 with blank lines).

**Who shaped it after that (24 people, oldest first):**
- 2013–2014: small fixes from Damien Klinnert, Simon Mansfield, Eric di Domenico, Mathias Buus, Typicode, Alberto Leal, Shane Tomlinson and Igor Soarez.
- 2015: Raymond Feng, max.laverse and Alejandro Caravaca Puchades contributed. Troy also made the ESLint switch (`fcd2b56`).
- 2017–2021: Benjamin Eidelman, LuisEGR and Douglas Christopher Wilson (4 commits, last on 2021-09-07).
- 2026-04-10: one commit by "Troy Goode <troy@laptop.example>".
- 2026-04-12: Fiona Formatter's reformat (`62628c0`).

## Whose code is still in it

Ordered by surviving lines (`git blame -w -M -C`, reformat `62628c0` ignored):

| author | lines | share (non-blank) | with blank | commits |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode (2 addresses) | 144 | 67.3% | 159 / 66.8% | 29 (46.8%) |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 20 | 9.3% | 22 / 9.2% | 4 |
| Alejandro Caravaca Puchades | 14 | 6.5% | 16 / 6.7% | 5 |
